silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_05_validation_and_shapes_sections_01_shape_gate_olog_node_concrete_anchor_1 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 01_shape_gate_olog_node #1', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Shape Gate as Olog Constraint Node' the bare symbol ConstraintSet anchors to VetRecordAboutMittens: The vet-record file Dr. Osei filled out during Mittens' 2024-03-15 check-up: a physical document carrying body mass (4.2 kg), age, and clinical notes — the raw packet before any Forge handling.." .
